sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant AM as Alertmanager
    participant API as Webhook Router
    participant ING as IngestionService
    participant DB as Database
    participant COR as CorrelationLoop
    participant TOP as TopologyService
    participant RCA as RCAService
    participant LLM as Ollama
    participant BUS as EventBus
    participant UI as SSE/UI

    AM->>API: POST /alerts/webhook/prometheus
    API->>ING: ingest_alertmanager_payload()
    ING->>ING: normalize + fingerprint
    ING->>DB: dedup check (ALERT_DEDUP_WINDOW)
    alt new alert
        ING->>DB: INSERT Alert (firing)
        ING->>BUS: publish("alerts", alert)
        BUS->>UI: push event
    end
    Note over COR: every correlation window
    COR->>DB: load recent alerts (CORRELATION_WINDOW_SECONDS)
    COR->>COR: Union-Find cluster (_pair_score)
    COR->>TOP: record_alerts() + learn_from_group()
    TOP->>TOP: upsert edges (EWMA weight, decay)
    COR->>TOP: rank_root_causes(entity_keys)
    TOP-->>COR: causal root + subgraph
    COR->>DB: UPSERT CorrelationGroup (signature dedup)
    COR->>RCA: generate_correlation_inference()
    RCA->>LLM: prompt (root + subgraph + alerts)
    LLM-->>RCA: JSON inference (~75s)
    RCA->>DB: store inference
    COR->>BUS: publish("correlations", group)
    BUS->>UI: push incident
    UI->>API: POST /rca/generate (on demand)
    API->>RCA: generate_rca_for_group()
    RCA->>RCA: _find_existing_rca (dedup/cache)
    alt cache miss
        RCA->>LLM: RCA prompt
        LLM-->>RCA: root_cause + remediation + confidence
        RCA->>DB: INSERT RCAReport
    end
    RCA-->>UI: RCA result
